   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## sdxl-base-art.json\n\nSDXL base art\n\n**Does:** prompt -> still image with SDXL (RealVisXL_V5.0_fp16 is the default checkpoint).\n**Knobs:** `cfg` and `steps` \u2014 **cfg 7 / 20 steps** is the value point; cfg 3 washes out, cfg 9\nover-burns, 30 steps buys nothing over 20.\n**Trap:** SDXL will not reliably give a full-body **solo** figure at 1024\u00b2 \u2014 say \"solo, single\nfigure, full body\" or you get a two-view sheet or a bust.\n**Note:** SDXL is now a **niche pick** \u2014 `z-image-turbo.json` is the modern, licence-clean\nbase model. Kept because the canonical asset set (E1d) came from here.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S1** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **E1/E1c/E1d** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## sdxl-base-art.json\n\nSDXL base art\n\n**Does:** prompt -> still image with SDXL (RealVisXL_V5.0_fp16 is the default checkpoint).\n**Knobs:** `cfg` and `steps` \u2014 **cfg 7 / 20 steps** is the value point; cfg 3 washes out, cfg 9\nover-burns, 30 steps buys nothing over 20.\n**Trap:** SDXL will not reliably give a full-body **solo** figure at 1024\u00b2 \u2014 say \"solo, single\nfigure, full body\" or you get a two-view sheet or a bust.\n**Note:** SDXL is now a **niche pick** \u2014 `z-image-turbo.json` is the modern, licence-clean\nbase model. Kept because the canonical asset set (E1d) came from here.\n\n---\n*How to run it: story **S1** in `HOWTO.md`  \u00b7  Why it is this way: **E1/E1c/E1d** in the scenarios' `EXPERIMENTS` logs.*"
   },
